cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these codelists, please cite the paper below and give the version of the codelists you used."
title: "InflAIM long-term condition codelists"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Codelists for 60 long-term conditions, for research on inflammation and
  multiple long-term conditions using UK electronic health records. Primary
  care codes are given as CPRD Aurum MedCodeIds, SNOMED CT and Read v2 codes;
  hospital codes are given as ICD-10 codes for Hospital Episode Statistics.
authors:
  - name: "InflAIM Study team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Inflaim-Study/Inflaim-LTC-code-list"
url: "https://github.com/Inflaim-Study/Inflaim-LTC-code-list"
keywords:
  - multimorbidity
  - multiple long-term conditions
  - inflammation
  - codelists
  - electronic health records
  - CPRD Aurum
  - SNOMED CT
  - Read codes
  - ICD-10
  - Hospital Episode Statistics
